<title>UK: PCI Bank sets $100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>PCI Bank sets $100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PCI BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    26.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    26.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD   +120-130 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	BA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	PHILIPPINE COMMERCIAL INTERNATIONAL BANK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
